<title>USA: FBI publicly seeks assistance in tobacco probe.</title>
<headline>FBI publicly seeks assistance in tobacco probe.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The FBI said Thursday it is seeking the assistance of current or former tobacco company officials in the continuing Justice Department criminal investigation involving the industry.</p>
<p>In a posting to the FBI's Web site, the FBI and the Justice Department said they are conducting a probe to determine whether any federal criminal laws had been violated by tobacco industry corporations, employees or representatives.</p>
</text>
